t će se", "en": "and he returns", "tr": "ve döner", "fr": "et il retourne", "id": "dan dia kembali", "ur": "اور وہ لوٹ آئے گا", "bn": "এবং সে ফিরে যায়", "fa": "و بازمی‌گردد"}}, {"text": "إِلَىٰٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَهْلِهِۦ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَسْرُورًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "7:119", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1073.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Thus were they there defeated and brought low.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Orada mağlup olmuş ve küçük düşmüşlerdi.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو یہاں وہ مغلوب پڑے اور ذلیل ہوکر پلٹے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka mereka kalah di tempat itu dan jadilah mereka orang-orang yang hina.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَغُلِبُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هُنَالِكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱنقَلَبُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/3e554ce3dde5564b6947.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i vratili su se", "en": "and they turned back", "tr": "ve geri döndüler", "fr": "et ils firent demi-tour", "id": "dan mereka berbalik", "ur": "اور وہ پلٹ گئے", "bn": "এবং তারা ফিরে গেল", "fa": "و بازگشتند"}}, {"text": "صَٰغِرِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "3:127", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/420.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "That He may cut off a part of those who disbelieve, or overwhelm them so that they retire, frustrated.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "(Allah bu yardımı) inkâr edenlerden bir kısmını kessin veya perişan etsin de umutsuz olarak dönüp gitsinler (diye yaptı).", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اس لئے کہ کافروں کا ایک حصہ کاٹ دے یا انہیں ذلیل کرے کہ نامراد پھر جائیں،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "(Allah menolong kamu dalam perang Badar dan memberi bala bantuan itu) untuk membinasakan segolongan orang-orang yang kafir, atau untuk menjadikan mereka hina, lalu mereka kembali dengan tiada memperoleh apa-apa.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "لِيَقْطَعَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "طَرَفًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِّنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كَفَرُوٓا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَوْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَكْبِتَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَيَنقَلِبُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/4158fcce99e95cc5133a.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "so they turn back", "bs": "pa se vraćaju", "tr": "böylece geri dönerler", "fr": "qu'ils reviennent alors", "id": "maka mereka kembali", "ur": "پس وہ پلٹتے ہیں", "bn": "অতএব তারা ফিরে যায়", "fa": "پس بازگردند"}}, {"text": "خَآئِبِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "3:149", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/442.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "O ye who believe! if ye obey those who disbelieve, they will make you turn back on your heels, and ye turn back as losers.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ey iman edenler! Siz eğer kâfir olanlara uyarsanız, sizi topuklarınız üstünde gerisin geriye çevirirler. O zaman büsbütün kaybedersiniz.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اے ایمان والو! اگر تم کافروں کے کہے پر چلے تو وہ تمہیں الٹے پاؤں لوٹادیں گے پھر ٹوٹا کھا کے پلٹ جاؤ گے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Hai orang-orang yang beriman, jika kamu mentaati orang-orang yang kafir itu, niscaya mereka mengembalikan kamu ke belakang (kepada kekafiran), lalu jadilah kamu orang-orang yang rugi.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "يَٰٓأَيُّهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ءَامَنُوٓا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تُطِيعُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كَفَرُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَرُدُّوكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَلَىٰٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَعْقَٰبِكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَتَنقَلِبُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/393dbd45d25cd00d6e57.m4a", "gloss": null, "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "jussive"}]}, {"text": "خَٰسِرِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "ٱنقَلَبْتُمْ", "count": 2, "first": "3:144", "audio": "audio/8838f49ee2a0e9e67719.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "you (all) turned back", "bs": "vratili ste se", "tr": "geri döndünüz", "fr": "vous vous êtes retournés", "id": "kalian telah kembali", "ur": "تم سب پلٹے", "bn": "তোমরা ফিরে গিয়েছিলে", "fa": "بازگشتید"}}, {"arabic": "يَنقَلِبْ", "count": 2, "first": "3:144", "audio": "audio/990e709ff5757acf6513.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "obje